# TypeScript

- Strict mode always on
- Prefer `type` imports: `import type { Foo } from '...'`
- Zod at API boundaries (request/response, env parsing)
- No `any`; use `unknown` + narrowing
- Prefix intentionally unused vars with `_`

```typescript
// BAD
catch (e) {}

// GOOD
catch (error) {
  logger.error('Failed', { error });
  throw error;
}
```
